"q": "What is the dictionary unit, and why does your own name get through?",
"a": "Treisman’s dictionary unit contains words, and each word has a threshold for being activated. Common or important words have low thresholds. Uncommon words have high thresholds. A person’s own name can have a low threshold, so it can be activated by a weakened message.",
