"q": "How was the 100-car study run?",
"a": "The 100-car study collected crash, pre-crash, near-crash and conflict data in a naturalistic setting. One hundred drivers used their own or leased cars on public roads for up to 13 months. No experimenter was present. Drivers were not coached or told to do anything other than drive normally.",
