"id": "G03-026",
"chapter": 3,
"number": 26,
"stem": "A demonstration asks you to visualize scenes such as an office, a department store clothing section, a lion, and a microscope. It often results in more details in the scene of the office or department store than the scene with the lion or microscope. The latter two tend to have fewer details because most individuals from modern society have less knowledge of _____ in those scenes.",
